{"id":"f3458f62defc55ad","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-mip.md","title":"df-mip (Multi-Prover Interactive Proof Class)","display":"df-mip (Multi-Prover Interactive Proof Class)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]"],"display":"df-mip (Multi-Prover Interactive Proof Class)","label":"28-df-mip","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-mip","MIP","Multi-Prover Interactive Proof Class"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §8.5","source_printed_pages":"163","source_pdf_pages":"189","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mip (Multi-Prover Interactive Proof Class)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-mip"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-mip</span><span>MIP</span><span>Multi-Prover Interactive Proof Class</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §8.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"163"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"189"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_h\">\\(U_h\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^h\">\\(\\Sigma^h\\)</span> 上的均匀分布（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(h\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span> 为固定证明者数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(t,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>验证者数据 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(t,b,p,Q_1,\\ldots,Q_k,D)\">\\(V=(t,b,p,Q_1,\\ldots,Q_k,D)\\)</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_j\">\\(Q_j\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 是确定型多项式时间函数，输出分别在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\le b(|x|)}\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\le b(|x|)}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，随机带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\">\\(r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Strat}_b\">\\(\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tup}_3\">\\(\\operatorname{tup}_3\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>；各证明者的策略参数仅为公共输入、自身随机带与自身问答历史。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下述消息递归及接受概率只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(t,b,p,Q_1,\\ldots,Q_k,D)\\in\\mathsf{MIV}_k\">\\(V=(t,b,p,Q_1,\\ldots,Q_k,D)\\in\\mathsf{MIV}_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_1,\\ldots,P_k\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\">\\(P_1,\\ldots,P_k\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(x\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\">\\(r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\)</span> 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 为序列拼接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span> 为空有限历史，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空比特串。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mip}}(\\langle h_1,\\ldots,h_k\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h_k)\\rangle)\\quad(h_1,\\ldots,h_k\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mip}}(\\langle h_1,\\ldots,h_k\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h_k)\\rangle)\\quad(h_1,\\ldots,h_k\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(x,r,H)\\coloneqq F(\\operatorname{tup}_3(x,r,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mip}}(H)))\\quad(F\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\ x,r\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ H\\in((\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega})^k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(x,r,H)\\coloneqq F(\\operatorname{tup}_3(x,r,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mip}}(H)))\\quad(F\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\ x,r\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ H\\in((\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega})^k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathsf{MIV}_k\\coloneqq\\{(t,b,p,Q_1,\\ldots,Q_k,D):\\;&amp;t,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n],\\ Q_1,\\ldots,Q_k,D\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\\\&amp;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ \\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\ \\forall H\\in((\\Sigma^{\\le b(|x|)})^{\\le2t(|x|)})^k\\ [D(x,r,H)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land\\forall j\\in[k]\\ |Q_j(x,r,H)|\\le b(|x|)]\\}.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathsf{MIV}_k\\coloneqq\\{(t,b,p,Q_1,\\ldots,Q_k,D):\\;&amp;t,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n],\\ Q_1,\\ldots,Q_k,D\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\\\&amp;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ \\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\ \\forall H\\in((\\Sigma^{\\le b(|x|)})^{\\le2t(|x|)})^k\\ [D(x,r,H)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\land\\forall j\\in[k]\\ |Q_j(x,r,H)|\\le b(|x|)]\\}.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_{j,0}\\coloneqq(),\\quad H_i\\coloneqq\\langle h_{1,i},\\ldots,h_{k,i}\\rangle\\quad(0\\le i\\le t(|x|)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_{j,0}\\coloneqq(),\\quad H_i\\coloneqq\\langle h_{1,i},\\ldots,h_{k,i}\\rangle\\quad(0\\le i\\le t(|x|)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q_{j,i}\\coloneqq Q_j(x,r,H_{i-1}),\\quad a_{j,i}\\coloneqq P_j(x,\\epsilon,h_{j,i-1}^{\\frown}\\langle q_{j,i}\\rangle),\\quad h_{j,i}\\coloneqq h_{j,i-1}^{\\frown}\\langle q_{j,i},a_{j,i}\\rangle\\quad(1\\le i\\le t(|x|),\\ 1\\le j\\le k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q_{j,i}\\coloneqq Q_j(x,r,H_{i-1}),\\quad a_{j,i}\\coloneqq P_j(x,\\epsilon,h_{j,i-1}^{\\frown}\\langle q_{j,i}\\rangle),\\quad h_{j,i}\\coloneqq h_{j,i-1}^{\\frown}\\langle q_{j,i},a_{j,i}\\rangle\\quad(1\\le i\\le t(|x|),\\ 1\\le j\\le k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_{P_1,\\ldots,P_k;V}(x)\\coloneqq\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}}[D(x,r,H_{t(|x|)})=1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Acc}_{P_1,\\ldots,P_k;V}(x)\\coloneqq\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{p(|x|)}}[D(x,r,H_{t(|x|)})=1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{MIP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\ \\exists V=(t,b,p,Q_1,\\ldots,Q_k,D)\\in\\mathsf{MIV}_k\\ \\exists P_1,\\ldots,P_k\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ [\\;&amp;\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P_1,\\ldots,P_k;V}(x)\\ge2/3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall P_1^*,\\ldots,P_k^*\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P_1^*,\\ldots,P_k^*;V}(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{MIP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\ \\exists V=(t,b,p,Q_1,\\ldots,Q_k,D)\\in\\mathsf{MIV}_k\\ \\exists P_1,\\ldots,P_k\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ [\\;&amp;\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P_1,\\ldots,P_k;V}(x)\\ge2/3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall P_1^*,\\ldots,P_k^*\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P_1^*,\\ldots,P_k^*;V}(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>每条策略函数的输入只包含自身局部历史；不能读取其他证明者的历史。这形式化了开始后不通信的经典模型。预先约定任意联合确定型策略被允许；经典共享随机性是这类策略的混合，不增加最优接受概率。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§8.5，印刷页 163；PDF 页 189。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R7复核：§8.5（PDF189）的非通信策略条件已核对；本次补明接受概率中的均匀验证者随机串，确定型共享策略的量词不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$U_h$ 为 $\\Sigma^h$ 上的均匀分布（$h\\in\\mathbb N$）；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]；$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}$ 为固定证明者数，$t,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Strat}_b$ 与 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}$ 见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]，$\\operatorname{tup}_3$ 采用 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]；各证明者的策略参数仅为公共输入、自身随机带与自身问答历史。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Strat}_b$ 与 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}$ 见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]，$\\operatorname{tup}_3$ 采用 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]；各证明者的策略参数仅为公共输入、自身随机带与自身问答历史。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U_h","